  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INWATER RESEARCH IN THE VICINITY OF DALYAN BEACH, TURKEY.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will; 1. identify fishing activities interacting with sea turtle populations using questionairres and on board observers; 2. develop leaflets for fisherman on safe handling and release of sea turtles; and 3. develop and post signs on nesting beaches and lagoons in Dalyan to educate tourists and fisherman about sea turtle conservation issues.</narrative>
  </description>
